{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:27fd9f5e563b7f50","name":"Droidification","source":{"id":"source:reference-27fd9f5e563b7f50","title":"Droidification","revision":19645,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:20:43Z","sha256":"eadeadb860269741657c145c131eb70ffbe8a896b2a3655faae64aef2847d209","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19645","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droidification&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-27fd9f5e563b7f50","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Droidification is an extensive process that turns a common piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," into a fully functioning ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," can either act as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with access to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," it was built from, or conceal itself as a normal piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},". While concealing itself as normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," can't take any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"},", and a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check is required to realize the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," is unusual.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Droidified Equipment uses the statistics of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["ASP Labor Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ASP_Labor_Droid","referenceId":"reference:02ba169e6b88d107"}," with the following modifications determined by the Equipment's size: -3 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},", +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", and -2 squares of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," per size smaller than Medium, but no score can be reduced to less than 1. (This is actual size, not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Size"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Size"},"; see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment Size"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment_Size"},".) Apply all modifiers to the statistics for the object's size as normal. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is automatically considered to have (and be proficient with) the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," it is built out of, and although it does not automatically gain any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," needed to use itself as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", owners commonly program the Droid's unspent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," on an appropriate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training","referenceId":"reference:fa24e9bf050e743e"}," feat. Only devices can receive this Upgrade. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," cannot be Droidified.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Example:"]}," Deel Surool owns a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"}," he'd like to be able to call (like a pet). Since a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"}," has only one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slot"},", he increases its size to Diminutive (due to its weight, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"}," is a Fine item). He then pays to have it Droidified. This makes it the equivalent of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["ASP Labor Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ASP_Labor_Droid","referenceId":"reference:02ba169e6b88d107"}," with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," 8, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 15, and a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," of 1 square. Since it is a walking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"},", Deel programs it to use its unassigned ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Training","referenceId":"reference:fa24e9bf050e743e"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," (giving it ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," +3), enough to download data from an unprotected system.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If any additional Droid Equipment or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," are added to the Droidified Equipment, it becomes obvious that the device is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," rather than the original item.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
